协调能力，性格开朗、勤奋工作，责任心强，能承受较大的工作压力，良好团队合作精神。\r\n","ClassificationOne":"业务类","ClassificationTwo":"西安分公司","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"4年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-04-22T10:43:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"509aceb1-b352-49ac-8013-f35ab0dd9ba2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351433136,"PostDateInt":1741758748000,"PostDate":"2025-03-12T13:52:28","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"JR202606080_大客户业务代表( 智能系统/杭州 )(J10880)","OrgId":985190,"Org":"ACN","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"一、职位名称：大客户业务代表( 智能系统/杭州 )\n二、职位描述：\n1、工作概要Job Purpose：\n向客户推荐最优方案，完成区域内客户销售任务目标。\n2、工作任务Task：\n（1）维护现有客户，拜访区域内或行业内目标客户，建立客户关系，捕捉合作商机；\n（2）分析客户需求状况和竞争对手产品状况，与售前技术支持人员共同编制最适合的建议方案；\n（3）完成行业大客户的市场定位，及时进行市场反馈、搜集并分析行业市场信息，建立客户资料档案管理；\